    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become master of <strong>time-lapsing...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong><i>Gardener: Master of Trees and Flowers</i></strong>, <i>the best time to plant a tree... is <strong>now</strong>. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With unlimited ability to <strong>accelerate years of growth in seconds</strong>, level up your gardens by nurturing complete local ecosystems and <strong>discovering new genetic traits</strong> from rare, native wild species to include in <strong>your own designs of unique</strong>, procedurally generated plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052790/extras/d74ceda9cbb8344c5617bc4c6abcdbc1.poster.avif?t=1749858950\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052790/extras/d74ceda9cbb8344c5617bc4c6abcdbc1.webm?t=1749858950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become master of <strong>botany...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fill  the soil with <strong>completely customizable cultivars</strong>, and hybridize them with <strong>perks found only among the wildest weeds</strong>, hidden in high level gardens. Find the balance between manually nurturing each of your plants, and letting nature take its course in symbiotic relationships between flora, fauna, and the Gardener.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052790/extras/f9f59d3830887551e6301d47e721f6d9.poster.avif?t=1749858950\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052790/extras/f9f59d3830887551e6301d47e721f6d9.webm?t=1749858950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become master of <strong>cultivation</strong>...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No plant is ever the same. Every branch and leaf has its own mutating genes, needs, and characteristics. <strong>Take clippings from stems to clone the mutated cultivars</strong>, trim the bushes, harvest fruits and flowers, and whack the invasive species, <strong>while preserving self-sustaining ecosystem chains</strong>, or force your will on nature with abundant pesticides, herbicides, and hyper-resistant GMO species, mowing your way to becoming Master Gardener.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052790/extras/b7f1165c7e03c0ae35a0a290056dfcb0.poster.avif?t=1749858950\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052790/extras/b7f1165c7e03c0ae35a0a290056dfcb0.webm?t=1749858950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become the <strong>Master Gardener</strong>.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up your gardens and discover new plant upgrades with two mischievous tree spirits, <i>Kodama</i> and <i>Yamabiko</i>, guiding you through authentic gardening techniques and mechanics In <strong>Gardener mode</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maximize your orchard yields  with the most comprehensive and in-depth botanical simulation ever made\u00a0in <strong>Realistic mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Design your dream, care-free gardens and plants in sandbox <strong>Creative mode</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052790/extras/5287681c82f6d62d1b08be25a020fb82.poster.avif?t=1749858950\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052790/extras/5287681c82f6d62d1b08be25a020fb82.webm?t=1749858950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over <strong>~10\u00b2\u2078 millions  possible plant species</strong> to discover, design, seed and grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cutting-edge simulated plants, brought to life <strong>down to a single leaf</strong>, bearing its own unique characteristics and conditions, grounded in horticultural and genetic research.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique and <strong>unrepeatable procedurally generated  specimens</strong>, shaped by a mix of genetics, random mutations, and gardening care.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grafting, pruning, and training <strong>techniques affecting yields</strong> and plant stress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design new species with dedicated Plant Creator editor, selective breeding, and artificial selection, with traits ranging <strong>from color differences and bigger fruits to herbicide resistance</strong> and rare patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Environment influences plant growth, accounting for light levels, <strong>hydration, pest interactions, microbial activity, fungal proliferation, and the availability of key nutrients</strong> such as Nitrogen (N), Phosphorus (P), Potassium (K), Calcium (Ca), Iron (Fe), and Magnesium (Mg).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simulated ecosystem chains of <strong>animals, insects, and microbial life</strong>, creating a living web of pests, prey, predators, and pollinators.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become master of <strong>time-lapsing...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong><i>Gardener: Master of Trees and Flowers</i></strong>, <i>the best time to plant a tree... is <strong>now</strong>. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With unlimited ability to <strong>accelerate years of growth in seconds</strong>, level up your gardens by nurturing complete local ecosystems and <strong>discovering new genetic traits</strong> from rare, native wild species to include in <strong>your own designs of unique</strong>, procedurally generated plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052790/extras/d74ceda9cbb8344c5617bc4c6abcdbc1.poster.avif?t=1749858950\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052790/extras/d74ceda9cbb8344c5617bc4c6abcdbc1.webm?t=1749858950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become master of <strong>botany...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fill  the soil with <strong>completely customizable cultivars</strong>, and hybridize them with <strong>perks found only among the wildest weeds</strong>, hidden in high level gardens. Find the balance between manually nurturing each of your plants, and letting nature take its course in symbiotic relationships between flora, fauna, and the Gardener.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052790/extras/f9f59d3830887551e6301d47e721f6d9.poster.avif?t=1749858950\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052790/extras/f9f59d3830887551e6301d47e721f6d9.webm?t=1749858950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become master of <strong>cultivation</strong>...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No plant is ever the same. Every branch and leaf has its own mutating genes, needs, and characteristics. <strong>Take clippings from stems to clone the mutated cultivars</strong>, trim the bushes, harvest fruits and flowers, and whack the invasive species, <strong>while preserving self-sustaining ecosystem chains</strong>, or force your will on nature with abundant pesticides, herbicides, and hyper-resistant GMO species, mowing your way to becoming Master Gardener.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052790/extras/b7f1165c7e03c0ae35a0a290056dfcb0.poster.avif?t=1749858950\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052790/extras/b7f1165c7e03c0ae35a0a290056dfcb0.webm?t=1749858950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become the <strong>Master Gardener</strong>.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up your gardens and discover new plant upgrades with two mischievous tree spirits, <i>Kodama</i> and <i>Yamabiko</i>, guiding you through authentic gardening techniques and mechanics In <strong>Gardener mode</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maximize your orchard yields  with the most comprehensive and in-depth botanical simulation ever made\u00a0in <strong>Realistic mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Design your dream, care-free gardens and plants in sandbox <strong>Creative mode</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052790/extras/5287681c82f6d62d1b08be25a020fb82.poster.avif?t=1749858950\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052790/extras/5287681c82f6d62d1b08be25a020fb82.webm?t=1749858950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over <strong>~10\u00b2\u2078 millions  possible plant species</strong> to discover, design, seed and grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cutting-edge simulated plants, brought to life <strong>down to a single leaf</strong>, bearing its own unique characteristics and conditions, grounded in horticultural and genetic research.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique and <strong>unrepeatable procedurally generated  specimens</strong>, shaped by a mix of genetics, random mutations, and gardening care.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grafting, pruning, and training <strong>techniques affecting yields</strong> and plant stress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design new species with dedicated Plant Creator editor, selective breeding, and artificial selection, with traits ranging <strong>from color differences and bigger fruits to herbicide resistance</strong> and rare patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Environment influences plant growth, accounting for light levels, <strong>hydration, pest interactions, microbial activity, fungal proliferation, and the availability of key nutrients</strong> such as Nitrogen (N), Phosphorus (P), Potassium (K), Calcium (Ca), Iron (Fe), and Magnesium (Mg).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simulated ecosystem chains of <strong>animals, insects, and microbial life</strong>, creating a living web of pests, prey, predators, and pollinators.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Cultivate unique gardens, timelapse seeds to blooming orchards in seconds, design procedurally generated plants, nurture ecosystems and discover rare genetic traits in wild flora, to create ultimate species, in state-of-the-art botanical simulation.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe game picks up where Creatura once laid the foundations - with fascinating genetic gimmicks, realistically simulated growth and an almost meditative gameplay loop. (...) Visually a small work of art - atmospherically almost therapeutic. Gardener presents itself visually at the highest level.\u201d<br>SPIELEMAGAZIN<br><br>\u201cWith over 10\u00b2\u2078 million possible plant species to try and discover and design as well as watch grow, the engine that Koksny has developed is really pushed to its limits. (...) A niche botanical sandbox simulation game that I found quite intriguing to play. Time certainly flies while you are having fun. It is rewarding to see your garden creations spring to life.\u201d<br>Thumb Culture<br>",
